  ex:vb-bias-chart a cd:ChartDefinition ; skos:prefLabel "Theoretical expectation versus Monte-Carlo mean"@en ; cd:body "Theory bars show exact expectations at each sample size. MC bars show the seeded 5000-repeat means, rounded to six decimals. n is independent sample size; MSD uses n; s² uses n−1. The target population variance is 4 (mg/L)²."@en ; cd:chartType cd:BarChart ; cd:xAxisLabel "Independent sample size n"@en ; cd:yAxisLabel "Variance"@en ; cd:yAxisUnit "(mg/L)²" ; cd:usesDataset ex:vb-bias-data ; cd:authoredResource true .
